This tutorial walks you through the steps to set up a [Private Path service](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-private-path-service-intro&format=markdown) between a provider and a set of consumers. With Private Path service, consumers access the application or service implemented by the provider through the IBM backbone without traversing the internet.
